<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts $1.00 lower than Wednesday's close. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>   Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    51.00-54.00</p>
</text>
